{"id":"743918416d7084a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Prefix Free Machine","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine — ZFC Recursion4 Prefix Free Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine — ZFC Recursion4 Prefix Free Machine","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine — ZFC Recursion4 Prefix Free Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,H,C,d\\in V\">\\(M,H,C,d\\in V\\)</span> (partial-machine graph, binary-string carrier, code set, and decoding graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(p,q\\in C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (program codes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S,\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S,\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}machine} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,C,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\{0,1\\}):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\{0,1\\})\\}\\land C\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(d,C,H)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(M)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\subseteq C\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\;(d(p)\\subseteq d(q)\\to p=q)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}machine} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,C,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\{0,1\\}):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\{0,1\\})\\}\\land C\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(d,C,H)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(M)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\subseteq C\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\;(d(p)\\subseteq d(q)\\to p=q)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Partial computable maps have natural-number inputs.  The bijection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:C\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(d:C\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> keeps that input type intact and applies prefix comparison only after decoding.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,H,C,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in C\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S,\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}machine} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,C,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\{0,1\\}):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\{0,1\\})\\}\\land C\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(d,C,H)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(M)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\subseteq C\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\;(d(p)\\subseteq d(q)\\to p=q)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"d:C\\to\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":1470,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f2ff6d2212fecee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S$ (prefix-free-machine predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine]])"},{"id":"8593ee4c3e2d37f1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4PrefixFreeMachine}_S$ (prefix-free-machine predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3273","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine.md|58-df-zfc-recursion4-prefix-free-machine]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","278f83d281480a6e","f4bf86f66c1444da","d583890235faf0d5"]}